  "texts": {
    "preamble": "Gurmit Singh vs State Of U.P. on 16 November, 2019 Author: Sudhir Agarwal Bench: Sudhir Agarwal High Court Of Judicature At Allahabad Court No. - 34 Case :- Criminal Revision No. - 1918 of 2000 Revisionist :- Gurmit Singh Opposite Party :- State of U.P. Counsel for Revisionist :- Javed Habib Counsel for Opposite Party :- Govt. Advocate Hon'ble Sudhir Agarwal,J. 1. Heard Sri Javed Habib, learned counsel for revisionist and learned A.G.A. for respondents. 2. This criminal revision under Section 397/401 Cr.P.C., has been filed aggrieved by the judgments and orders dated 31.12.1997 and 14.08.2000.",
    "facts": "2. This criminal revision under Section 397/401 Cr.P.C., has been filed aggrieved by the judgments and orders dated 31.12.1997 and 14.08.2000.",
    "arguments": "This aspect has been considered by Supreme Court very recently in Vijendra Vs. State of U.P. and others (Criminal Appeal No. 1167 of 2019) (Arising out of S.L.P. (Criminal) No. 4314 of 2015) decided on 31.07.2019 and in para 15 of judgment, Court has said as under: \"The very purpose of furnishing such report is to enable the Accused to seek for reference to the Central Food Laboratory for analysis if the Accused is dissatisfied with the report.",
    "petitioner_arguments": "",
    "respondent_arguments": "",
    "other_lawyer_arguments": "This aspect has been considered by Supreme Court very recently in Vijendra Vs. State of U.P. and others (Criminal Appeal No. 1167 of 2019) (Arising out of S.L.P. (Criminal) No. 4314 of 2015) decided on 31.07.2019 and in para 15 of judgment, Court has said as under: \"The very purpose of furnishing such report is to enable the Accused to seek for reference to the Central Food Laboratory for analysis if the Accused is dissatisfied with the report."
  },
